//- A layout can draw a fragment as well as a document: here, a card whose
//- title, body and footer are blocks. Each block's children are its default.
+card(variant="outlined")
  @header
    h3(data-part="title")
      block title
        | Untitled project
  @body
    block content
      p Nothing here yet.
  @footer
    block footer
      p Drawn on the server.
